    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i’ve been having this weird, crampy feeling in my lower right stomach area since yesterday. it’s not super intense but it’s definitely uncomfortable and i feel kinda nauseous too. i feel like something is just stuck or backed up in there. what do you think i should do to get some relief?",
